v\" href=\"/\">Főoldal</a><a class=\"link-nav\" href=\"/kompatibilitas\">Kompatibilitás</a><a class=\"link-nav\" href=\"/alkatreszek\">Alkatrészek</a><a class=\"link-nav\" href=\"/garazs\">Garázs</a><a class=\"link-nav link-nav-active\" href=\"/utitervek\">Útiterv</a></div><div class=\"hidden items-center gap-3 lg:flex\"><a class=\"grid h-9 w-9 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-ink-600 text-graphite-300 transition-colors hover:border-brand-500/50 hover:text-white\" aria-label=\"Alkatrészkereső\" href=\"/alkatreszek\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search h-4 w-4\"><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle><path d=\"m21 21-4.3-4.3\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"btn-ghost\" href=\"/bejelentkezes\">Bejelentkezés</a><a class=\"btn-primary\" href=\"/regisztracio\">Regisztráció</a></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl border border-ink-600 text-graphite-200 lg:hidden\" aria-label=\"Menü\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu h-5 w-5\"><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"12\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"6\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"4\" x2=\"20\" y1=\"18\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></nav></header><main class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"container-page py-10 sm:py-14\"><div class=\"\"><div class=\"mb-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brand-400\"><span class=\"h-px w-6 bg-brand-500/60\"></span>Fejlesztési útiterv</div><h2 class=\"section-title\">A jelenlegi állapot és a következő fázisok</h2><p class=\"section-sub\">Az AutoFit AI egy valós adatbázisra épülő platform. Az alábbi modulok későbbi fejlesztésként jelennek meg a felületen.</p></div><div class=\"mt-6\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3 rounded-xl border border-emerald-500/25 bg-emerald-500/[0.07] px-4 py-3\" role=\"note\"><span class=\"mt-0.5 grid h-5 w-5 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full bg-emerald-500/20 text-[11px] font-bold text-emerald-300\">i</span><p class=\"text-xs leading-relaxed text-emerald-100/90 sm:text-sm\"><strong class=\"font-semibold text-emerald-200\">Valós adatbázis.</strong> Az alkatrész-, jármű- és kompatibilitási adatok a csatlakoztatott Supabase (PostgreSQL) adatbázisból származnak. A kompatibilitást kizárólag a <span class=\"font-mono\">fitments</span> tábla rekordjai döntik el – a rendszer nem talál ki adatot.</p></div></div><section class=\"mt-12\"><div class=\"mb-6 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-brand-500/10 text-brand-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg></span><div><h2 class=\"font-display text-lg font-bold text-white\">Későbbi funkciók</h2><p class=\"text-xs text-graphite-400\">Ezek a modulok egyelőre nem működnek – csak helyet kapnak a felületen.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"card relative overflow-hidden p-5\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute right-0 top-0 h-24 w-24 rounded-full bg-brand-500/[0.06] blur-2xl\"></div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink-800 text-graphite-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-camera h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M14.5 4h-5L7 7H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h16a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V9a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-3l-2.5-3z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"13\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-ink-600 bg-ink-800/70 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-graphite-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock h-3 w-3\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg>Tervezett</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-base font-bold text-white\">AI alkatrész felismerés képből</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Fotózd le az alkatrészt, és a rendszer felismeri a típust, majd javaslatot ad a kompatibilitásra.</p><div class=\"mt-4 border-t border-ink-700 pt-3\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-graphite-500\">Nem elérhető ebben a verzióban</span></div></div><div class=\"card relative overflow-hidden p-5\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute right-0 top-0 h-24 w-24 rounded-full bg-brand-500/[0.06] blur-2xl\"></div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink-800 text-graphite-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-car h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M19 17h2c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-3c0-.9-.7-1.7-1.5-1.9C18.7 10.6 16 10 16 10s-1.3-1.4-2.2-2.3c-.5-.4-1.1-.7-1.8-.7H5c-.6 0-1.1.4-1.4.9l-1.4 2.9A3.7 3.7 0 0 0 2 12v4c0 .6.4 1 1 1h2\"></path><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M9 17h6\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-ink-600 bg-ink-800/70 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-graphite-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock h-3 w-3\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg>Tervezett</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-base font-bold text-white\">VIN alapú kompatibilitás</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">A jármű VIN kódjából automatikus járműazonosítás, így a kézi kiválasztás helyett azonnal pontos adatok.</p><div class=\"mt-4 border-t border-ink-700 pt-3\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-graphite-500\">Nem elérhető ebben a verzióban</span></div></div><div class=\"card relative overflow-hidden p-5\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute right-0 top-0 h-24 w-24 rounded-full bg-brand-500/[0.06] blur-2xl\"></div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink-800 text-graphite-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-database h-5 w-5\"><ellipse cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" rx=\"9\" ry=\"3\"></ellipse><path d=\"M3 5V19A9 3 0 0 0 21 19V5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12A9 3 0 0 0 21 12\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-ink-600 bg-ink-800/70 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-graphite-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock h-3 w-3\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg>Tervezett</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-base font-bold text-white\">Külső adatforrás integráció</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Éles gyártói és kereskedői adatforrások (TecDoc, gyártói feedek) integrálása a jelenlegi adatbázis mellé.</p><div class=\"mt-4 border-t border-ink-700 pt-3\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-graphite-500\">Nem elérhető ebben a verzióban</span></div></div><div class=\"card relative overflow-hidden p-5\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute right-0 top-0 h-24 w-24 rounded-full bg-brand-500/[0.06] blur-2xl\"></div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink-800 text-graphite-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-boxes h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M2.97 12.92A2 2 0 0 0 2 14.63v3.24a2 2 0 0 0 .97 1.71l3 1.8a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0L12 19v-5.5l-5-3-4.03 2.42Z\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5-4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"m7 16.5 5-3\"></path><path d=\"M7 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V19l3.97 2.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.06 0l3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0 .97-1.71v-3.24a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71L17 10.5l-5 3Z\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5-5-3\"></path><path d=\"m17 16.5 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M17 16.5v5.17\"></path><path d=\"M7.97 4.42A2 2 0 0 0 7 6.13v4.37l5 3 5-3V6.13a2 2 0 0 0-.97-1.71l-3-1.8a2 2 0 0 0-2.06 0l-3 1.8Z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8 7.26 5.15\"></path><path d=\"m12 8 4.74-2.85\"></path><path d=\"M12 13.5V8\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-ink-600 bg-ink-800/70 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-graphite-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock h-3 w-3\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg>Tervezett</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-base font-bold text-white\">3D autó konfigurátor</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Interaktív 3D modell, ahol a kiválasztott alkatrészek és tuning elemek valós időben megjelennek.</p><div class=\"mt-4 border-t border-ink-700 pt-3\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-graphite-500\">Nem elérhető ebben a verzióban</span></div></div><div class=\"card relative overflow-hidden p-5\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute right-0 top-0 h-24 w-24 rounded-full bg-brand-500/[0.06] blur-2xl\"></div><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink-800 text-graphite-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-gauge h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"m12 14 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-ink-600 bg-ink-800/70 px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-graphite-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock h-3 w-3\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg>Tervezett</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-base font-bold text-white\">Tuning kompatibilitás</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Teljesítménynövelő és futómű-tuning alkatrészek kompatibilitásának vizsgálata a gyári paraméterekhez képest.</p><div class=\"mt-4 border-t border-ink-700 pt-3\"><span class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-graphite-500\">Nem elérhető ebben a verzióban</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mt-14\"><div class=\"mb-6 flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg></span><div><h2 class=\"font-display text-lg font-bold text-white\">Már elérhető</h2><p class=\"text-xs text-graphite-400\">Ezek a funkciók teljes egészében működnek az adatbázisra épülő platformon.</p></div></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"card p-5\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-gauge h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"m12 14 4-4\"></path><path d=\"M3.34 19a10 10 0 1 1 17.32 0\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-sm font-bold text-white\">Kompatibilitás ellenőrző</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Teljes folyamat az adatbázis fitments táblája alapján, részletes eredménykártyával.</p></div><div class=\"card p-5\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-wrench h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-sm font-bold text-white\">Alkatrészkereső</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Keresés, szűrés, rendezés és részletes alkatrészkártyák az adatbázisból.</p></div><div class=\"card p-5\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-car h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M19 17h2c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-3c0-.9-.7-1.7-1.5-1.9C18.7 10.6 16 10 16 10s-1.3-1.4-2.2-2.3c-.5-.4-1.1-.7-1.8-.7H5c-.6 0-1.1.4-1.4.9l-1.4 2.9A3.7 3.7 0 0 0 2 12v4c0 .6.4 1 1 1h2\"></path><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"></circle><path d=\"M9 17h6\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-sm font-bold text-white\">Autógarázs</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Járművek mentése, szerkesztése és alapértelmezett beállítása – bejelentkezve.</p></div><div class=\"card p-5\"><span class=\"grid h-11 w-11 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-layers h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z\"></path><path d=\"M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12\"></path><path d=\"M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17\"></path></svg></span><h3 class=\"mt-4 font-display text-sm font-bold text-white\">Admin felület</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-graphite-400\">Alkatrészek, import, felhasználók és statisztikák kezelése.</p></div></div></section><div class=\"card mt-14 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 p-8 text-center sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:text-left\"><div><h3 class=\"font-display text-lg font-bold text-white\">Próbáld ki a jelenlegi funkciókat</h3><p class=\"mt-1 text-sm text-graphite-400\">Minden elérhető funkció használható – nézd meg a kompatibilitás ellenőrzőt vagy az alkatrészkeresőt.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3\"><a class=\"btn-primary\" href=\"/kompatibilitas\">Ellenőrzés indítása<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg